cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "The Dissecting Dual (Pillar II)"
abstract: >-
  An interactive 3D viewer for six figurate polyhedral number families.
  Each figure appears as its assembled integer lattice or dissected into
  tetrahedral atoms (for the four convex families, the tetrahedra of a
  pointed triangulation), and a slider moves continuously between the two
  views.
authors:
